        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Comparing",
            "id": 62166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita sudah mempelajari cara membuat dan menyimpan nilai, tetapi bagaimana cara membandingkannya?</p><p>Kita perlu membandingkan angka dalam situasi seperti memeriksa apakah PIN yang dimasukkan pengguna cocok dengan PIN yang tersimpan.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enteredPin = \" /><text value=\"5448\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" expectedPin = \" /><text value=\"5440\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equality operator",
            "id": 62168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membandingkan apakah dua angka sama, kita menggunakan <strong>operator kesetaraan</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"5 === 5\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True or false",
            "id": 62169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [
              {
                "id": "c25f4263-3c52-44c4-b06e-9616458fc0eb"
              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membandingkan, hanya ada dua hasil: <code>true</code> atau <code>false</code>.</p><img src=\"c25f4263-3c52-44c4-b06e-9616458fc0eb\" visible-if=\"always\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 62170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita membandingkan angka yang sama dengan operator kesamaan, hasilnya adalah <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>10</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita membandingkan angka yang sama dengan operator kesamaan, hasilnya adalah <code>true</code>.</p><p>Gunakan <code>===</code> untuk membandingkan angka yang sama agar konsol menampilkan <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>10</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>, dan terakhir <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 62171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita membandingkan dua angka yang berbeda dengan operator equality, hasilnya adalah <code>false</code>.</p><p>Pilih opsi yang membandingkan <code>9</code> dengan <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>9 === 10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita membandingkan dua angka yang berbeda dengan operator equality, hasilnya adalah <code>false</code>.</p><p>Gunakan operator kesamaan untuk membandingkan <code>9</code> dengan <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"11\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>, diikuti oleh <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang kita gunakan untuk memeriksa apakah dua angka sama?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>===</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang kita gunakan untuk memeriksa apakah dua angka sama? Operator mana yang membuat perbandingan <code>7</code> dengan <code>7</code> menghasilkan <code>true</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>!==</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kedua nilai dalam perbandingan ini berbeda. Apa yang ditampilkan di console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam situasi mana kita perlu memeriksa apakah dua angka sama?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Saat memeriksa apakah jumlah nyawa pemain yang tersisa <em>tepat</em> 5</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Saat memeriksa apakah jumlah nyawa pemain yang tersisa <em>kurang dari atau sama dengan</em> 3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Saat memeriksa apakah jumlah nyawa pemain yang tersisa <em>tepat</em> 5.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menyimpan sisa nyawa di <code>lives</code>. Pemeriksaan mana yang menunjukkan apakah pemain memiliki tepat <code>5</code> nyawa?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>lives === 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>lives = 5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>lives === 0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>lives === 5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"18\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> lalu <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu mengganti <code>===</code> dengan <code>+</code> di baris kedua. Apa yang akan ditampilkan kedua baris sekarang?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"18\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">18 lalu 18</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">18 lalu false</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">false lalu 18</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 18 lalu 18.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah nilai <code>votes</code> sama dengan <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" votes = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(votes === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat nilai <code>votes</code> yang ada menghasilkan <code>false</code> saat dibandingkan dengan angka yang berbeda.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" votes = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(votes === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"votes\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 62198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan operator perbandingan kesamaan.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi perbandingan agar console menampilkan <code>false</code> untuk <code>99</code> dan <code>100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 62200,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>false</code> di console.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan operator kesetaraan untuk membandingkan <code>10</code> dengan variabel <code>dogs</code> agar console menampilkan <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dogs\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dogs\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Dogs\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>===</code>, diikuti oleh <code>dogs</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 62199,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah angka-angka ini sama dengan mengetikkan <code>===</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 7178,
        "title": "Operator ketidaksamaan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Not equal",
            "id": 62182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memeriksa apakah sebuah angka tidak sama dengan angka lainnya, kita menggunakan <strong>operator ketidaksamaan</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Result !==",
            "id": 62178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan dengan operator ketidaksamaan dalam sebuah variabel.</p><p>Simpan perbandingan antara <code>1</code> dan <code>2</code> ke dalam variabel <code>result</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan dengan operator ketidaksamaan dalam sebuah variabel.</p><p>Lengkapi baris agar <code>result</code> menampilkan <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Result ===",
            "id": 62176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel juga dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan kesamaan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel juga dapat menyimpan hasil perbandingan kesamaan.</p><p>Lengkapi baris agar <code>result</code> menampilkan <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare variables",
            "id": 62179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
